<title>USA: Hershey and Huntamaki sign agreement.</title>
<headline>Hershey and Huntamaki sign agreement.</headline>
<dateline>HERSHEY, Pa. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hershey Foods Corp said on Tuesday it signed a definitive agreement with Huhtamaki Oy of Helsinki, Finland, providing for Hershey to acquire Huhtamaki's Leaf North American confectionery business and for Huhtamaki to acquire Hershey's European confectionery operations in Germany and Italy.</p>
<p>A preliminary agreement had been reached on October 18, 1996.  Closing is expected at the end of this year subject to regulatory approvals.</p>
<p>Hershey was up 1/4 at 51 in afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
